  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2025 Syria Regional Appeal - Syria - Emergency preparedness</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Due to growing instability in the region, UNRWA will strengthen emergency preparedness in Syria by training 100 personnel in emergency stock maintenance, rapid procurement of supplies, shelter management with WASH facilities, child protection for separated children, temporary emergency health care and physiotherapy, and psychological first aid. The Agency will also procure and store sufficient contingency NFIs - including blankets, mattresses, kitchen sets, jerry cans, and hygiene kits - to support displaced or affected families during sudden-onset emergencies.</narrative>
  </description>
